{"path":"math/functions","title":"函数","type":"category","html":"<p>函数主线：<strong>概念 → 图像性质 → 基本初等函数（指数/对数/幂）→ 三角函数 → 导数</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择题的&quot;恒成立/零点/单调性&quot;问题，邪修神器：特殊值法、端点效应、图像法</li>\n<li>大题压轴（导数）必须标准解法，邪修只用来快速猜答案、验算</li>\n</ul>\n","meta":{"status":"ok","keywords":[],"summary":"函数是高中数学的灵魂：概念与性质、基本初等函数、三角函数、导数。高考压轴题基本都从这里出。","fit":[]},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"math","title":"数学"},{"slug":"functions","title":"函数"}],"children":[{"slug":"abstract-functions","title":"抽象函数","type":"category"},{"slug":"concepts-properties","title":"函数概念与性质","type":"category"},{"slug":"derivatives","title":"导数","type":"category"},{"slug":"exponential-log","title":"指数与对数","type":"category"},{"slug":"trigonometry","title":"三角函数","type":"category"}],"siblings":[{"slug":"algebra","title":"代数","type":"category"},{"slug":"geometry","title":"几何","type":"category"},{"slug":"methods","title":"解题方法专题","type":"category"},{"slug":"statistics","title":"统计与概率","type":"category"}]}